WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:04.359
Beauty ran through the forest.

2
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.567
Trees lay on the ground.

3
00:00:07.568 --> 00:00:13.111
The sounds of axes and saws filled the air.

4
00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:17.267
Beauty looked for the tunnel of trees.

5
00:00:17.268 --> 00:00:20.746
But she couldn't find it anywhere.

6
00:00:20.747 --> 00:00:24.396
Crack! Crash!

7
00:00:24.397 --> 00:00:28.549
"I'm too late," Beauty thought.

8
00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:33.256
"The men will clear the forest and find Beast!"

9
00:00:33.257 --> 00:00:36.103
She wiped away a tear.

10
00:00:36.104 --> 00:00:40.514
When she looked up, Deer stood there.

11
00:00:40.515 --> 00:00:45.064
"Deer! Is Beast okay?" Beauty said.

12
00:00:45.065 --> 00:00:52.427
Deer waved a hoof for Beauty to follow her.

13
00:00:52.428 --> 00:00:57.645
They quickly reached the tunnel of trees.

14
00:00:57.646 --> 00:01:00.991
And just like that . . .

15
00:01:00.992 --> 00:01:04.114
They were in the garden!

16
00:01:04.115 --> 00:01:10.270
Beauty and Deer ran into the castle.

17
00:01:10.271 --> 00:01:15.115
"Where's Beast!" Beauty cried.

18
00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:18.368
They looked for him in the dining room.

19
00:01:18.369 --> 00:01:23.130
He wasn't there.

20
00:01:23.131 --> 00:01:27.450
They looked for him in the library.

21
00:01:27.451 --> 00:01:30.862
He wasn't there either.

22
00:01:30.863 --> 00:01:39.165
Then Deer headed for the closed doors.

23
00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:44.641
Beast's roar echoed in Beauty's memory.

24
00:01:44.642 --> 00:01:51.061
"Deer! I . . . I can't go in there," Beauty said.

25
00:01:51.062 --> 00:01:56.638
But Deer kicked the doors open. Smash!

26
00:01:56.639 --> 00:01:59.855
The room was dark and cold.

27
00:01:59.856 --> 00:02:02.495
Beauty gulped.

28
00:02:02.496 --> 00:02:08.151
The rose had only three petals left.

29
00:02:08.152 --> 00:02:13.198
Beast was lying on the bed.

30
00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:16.584
Beauty rushed to his side.

31
00:02:16.585 --> 00:02:20.199
She told him about the woodcutters.

32
00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.897
"I'm growing weaker," Beast said.

33
00:02:24.898 --> 00:02:28.780
"So is the magic of the castle.

34
00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:32.004
Everything will die soon."

35
00:02:32.005 --> 00:02:35.797
"How can I help you?" Beauty said.

36
00:02:35.798 --> 00:02:40.162
"Why do you care about me?" he asked.

37
00:02:40.163 --> 00:02:44.733
"I'm a beast."

38
00:02:44.734 --> 00:02:55.677
"You're my friend," she said softly.

39
00:02:55.678 --> 00:03:01.164
"But could you ever love me?" Beast asked.

40
00:03:01.165 --> 00:03:05.694
"Would you ever marry a beast like me?"

41
00:03:05.695 --> 00:03:08.826
Beauty bit her lip.

42
00:03:08.827 --> 00:03:14.181
He could be unkind but . . .

43
00:03:14.182 --> 00:03:18.823
"Your silence is your answer," Beast said.

44
00:03:18.824 --> 00:03:21.053
"Please go."

45
00:03:21.054 --> 00:03:27.945
He closed his eyes and turned away.

